---
---

<section class="py-20 sm:py-24 px-6 bg-ai-surface relative overflow-hidden border-b border-ai-border">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-5 text-ai-fg">
        What We Do
      </h2>
      <p class="text-ai-fg-muted text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Surrey Artificial Intelligence Society is a student-led community for learning, building, discussing, and applying artificial intelligence. We welcome students from every discipline and experience level.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
      <div class="bg-ai-bg border border-ai-border p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-ai-cyan/10 text-ai-cyan mb-6" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mb-3 text-ai-fg">Learn</h3>
        <p class="text-ai-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
          Beginner-friendly workshops on machine learning, generative AI, computer vision, and more. No prerequisites &mdash; just curiosity.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-ai-bg border border-ai-border p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-ai-purple/10 text-ai-purple mb-6" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mb-3 text-ai-fg">Build</h3>
        <p class="text-ai-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
          Hands-on build nights, collaborative projects, and hackathons where you turn ideas into working prototypes alongside other students.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-ai-bg border border-ai-border p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-500 mb-6" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-xl mb-3 text-ai-fg">Connect</h3>
        <p class="text-ai-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
          Join a welcoming community of AI-curious students, attend discussions on ethics and policy, and shape how AI is understood at Surrey.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
